# Normalize text to LF in the repo regardless of the checkout platform.
#
# Why this exists: the repo is edited from a Windows working copy that was rewriting every
# text file with CRLF endings, so `git status` showed 11 files "modified" with zero real
# content change. That noise makes it impossible to see a genuine listing diff and would
# have been pushed as a 569-line phantom changeset. (Found 2026-07-29.)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
